  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  title: Report H-7
  body: 'DRAFT (Abdelhamid: final text)


    Serum H-7 works. Injected subjects
    stop burning through blood: the hunger, the decay, the clock, all of it stops.


    Side
    effect: the subjects are weak. No reserve, no tricks. They sleep most of the
    day.


    Testing continues on every subject in the holding cells. Do NOT feed
    them.'
